					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "SQUARE VORTEX\n\nThis patch demonstrates how easy it is in Wire to create really pretty imagery with just a few nodes. The Linear node is really the star of the show in this patch. Nearly everything is modulated by the Linear node. This causes some really smooth steps between the instanced shapes."
					}
				},
